<title>USA: Dotronix to enter auto accessory business.</title>
<headline>Dotronix to enter auto accessory business.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRIGHTON, Minn. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dotronix Inc said Friday it will announce its entry into the automobile accessory business at the Vacation Camping R.V. Show in Minneapolis this weekend.</p>
<p>The company said its first new product will be a sports utility vehicle cargo carrier that adds 15 cubic feet of additional cargo space. Dotronix said the carrier will sell for $795.</p>
<p>Dotronix makes high-resolution video displays.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
